chapter Formalizations

session Frieze_Family = HOL +
  description \<open>
    For every even n >= 14, two integer Conway-Coxeter friezes of width n - 3 whose middle rows are strictly
    ordered: an infinite family of integer counterexamples to Tabachnikov's four-sign-change question.
  \<close>
  options [timeout = 1200]
  theories
    Frieze_Family
